<title>POLAND: KREDYT BANK TAKES 35 PCT OF INSURER.</title>
<headline>KREDYT BANK TAKES 35 PCT OF INSURER.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish bank Kredyt Bank SA said in a statement it has acquired a 35 percent stake in a farming insurance company Agropolisa SA for 1.5 million zlotys, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not give any further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
